//// rakun-starter-data-sql — a starter: a curated dependency set, and no code.
////
//// Declaring it pulls `rakun-starter` and `rakun-data` (the DataSource and its pool, `SqlTemplate`, `#[query]`, `#[transactional]`). An application keeps importing from the modules
//// themselves (`from "rakun-web"`, `from "rakun-cache"`, …); nothing is
//// importable from the starter, so a starter can drop a module without
//// breaking an import. The versions are `rakun/version_set`'s.
